  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Live path",
      "items": [
        "invest-ingest generates and persists proposals hourly",
        "invest-api clamps and submits orders on approval"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Single source of risk truth",
      "items": [
        "risk_engine.evaluate_proposal() is called from the live signal generator (audit-only), the live approval endpoint (binding), and the Monte Carlo backtest -- same function, so live and backtest sizing cannot drift apart",
        "Trade Thesis Lifecycle and the backtest engine both read/write PostgreSQL directly (omitted as edges here to keep this map readable -- see order-risk-path.json for the exact write)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "External",
      "items": [
        "PostgreSQL is externally managed, not containerized here",
        "Alpaca is the only broker integration",
        "Digest/ATQ handoff is this repo's one outbound integration to the homelab's agent task queue"
      ]
    }
  ]
